-- נספחים א'19'-א'22' — סגנים קיימים (אקדמאים, בכירים, מוסמכים, בלתי מוסמכים), מעודכנות החל מיום 1.9.2016: the tables of the existing first deputies — academic, senior, certified and uncertified, as the conditions-of-service portal publishes them
-- under the annex numbers the corpus gives them (א'19–א'22). They are the
-- principals' and first deputies' tables of the agreement of 4.3.2015
-- (encoded, imported) — its annexes יב–טו, from 1.3.2014 and printed to
-- the shekel — as they stand from 1.1.2015, printed to the agora.
--
-- What produces them: the agreement of 4.3.2015's tables stood, like every
-- reform table from 1.4.2013, 5.75% above the tables in force before the
-- update of 1.1.2011 (the third part of the 2011 framework, imported); the
-- framework's last allocation, which the agreement of 22.7.2013 put off to
-- 1.1.2015 (imported), took them to 6.35% (§92(ג) of the completion
-- agreement). So each cell here, taken back by 1.0575/1.0635, is the 2015
-- table's cell to the nearest shekel — checked below over every cell. The
-- September 2016 agreement, from whose day (1.9.2016) the page prints the
-- tables, sets no new principals' tables.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2015-03-04_ofek-hadash_principals-pay-changes`
IMPORT `2015-01-01_ofek-hadash_salary-tables_morim`

§ `נספחים א'19'-א'22' — סגנים קיימים (אקדמאים, בכירים, מוסמכים, בלתי מוסמכים), מעודכנות החל מיום 1.9.2016`

-- akn:attachments The heading over the tables; a label row with no text of its own.

-- The page prints once, under its last table, "טבלה מעודכנת החל מיום
-- 1.9.2016": the day of every table on it.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p2
`the managers' tables of sganim-rishonim-kayamim are updated from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2016

-- Annex א'19 (att_1): סגנים אקדמאים קיימים; the 2015 agreement's annex יב.
